@startuml
!pragma teoz true
title SSD 1 — Request Appointment (UC03)
hide footbox
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
actor AdministrativeStaff as Staff
participant ":System" as System
note over Staff,System
Authenticated staff books for a registered patient at the clinic or by phone.
A Patient may use the same operations only for their own record.
end note
Staff -> System: searchPatient(criteria)
alt no matching patient
  System --> Staff: [] — No patient found
else patient found
  System --> Staff: matching patients (patientID, name, dateOfBirth)
  note left of Staff: Staff chooses patientID;\nno implicit choice among matches.
  Staff -> System: searchAvailability(serviceID, professionalID?, locationID?, dateRange, specialtyID?)
  alt no eligible slots
    System --> Staff: [] — No availability
    opt patient requests a waiting-list place
      Staff -> System: joinWaitingList(patientID, serviceID, locationID,\nprofessionalID?, specialtyID?, dateRange, referralID?)
      System --> Staff: entryID, status = waiting (or validation failure)
    end
  else eligible slots exist
    System --> Staff: slots (professionalID, dateTime, locationID)
    Staff -> System: requestAppointment(patientID, serviceID, professionalID,\nlocationID, dateTime, referralID?, waitingListEntryID?)
    alt all scheduling, referral and resource checks pass
      System --> Staff: appointmentID, status = requested
    else slot taken, outside schedule, or patient/professional overlap
      System --> Staff: slotUnavailable
    else required resource cannot be allocated
      System --> Staff: resourceUnavailable
    else referral missing or invalid
      System --> Staff: referralRequired / referralInvalid
    else access denied, invalid input, or audit failure
      System --> Staff: accessDenied / invalidInput / notFound / auditUnavailable
    end
  end
end
note over Staff,System
Search is advisory, not a reservation. Booking revalidates and reserves the
full service interval plus required resources atomically. No automatic confirmation.
Ordinary booking omits waitingListEntryID; SSD 5 supplies the exact accepted entry.
A failed booking may be followed by a new search and an explicit waitlist request.
end note
@enduml
